  "details": "Please add two avatar animator parameters that trigger briefly when a user spawns or leaves. They replicate for up to five seconds to play a small join/exit effect, then the avatar spawns/despawns normally. During this window the avatar is non-interactive. Effects respect block/mute/safety settings and can be turned off by viewers. This makes joins and exits feel smoother (e.g., quick portal-in or dissolve).",
